# Clang-Tidy configuration for tests
#
# All checks disabled (issue #590). Measured 2026-08-20: clang-tidy's wall time
# per TU is ~100% check-execution cost over the AST `import storm;` pulls in
# (parsing itself is ~0s — `--checks='-*'` is instant). tests/** already has NO
# SonarCloud coverage (sonar.exclusions), so this removes the only static
# analysis those files had — accepted tradeoff for commit-time speed.
Checks: '-*'
